; Demo journal for hledger-anywhere.
;
; This is the journal behind the built-in "Load demo journal" button, and the
; input for the fixture files in this directory. It is small on purpose but
; exercises the things the decoder and the panels must get right:
;
;   * two commodities with different symbols and styles ($ and EUR)
;   * an inferred (amount-less) posting inside a multi-commodity transaction
;   * account names deep enough to make tree/flat reporting interesting
;   * cleared and pending transaction statuses
;   * a tag, both bare and with a value
;   * an include directive, so multi-file journals are covered end to end
;
; Keep this file readable: it is documentation as much as test data.

include extra.journal

2024-01-01 * Opening balances
    assets:bank:checking            $1,000.00
    assets:bank:savings               500.00 EUR
    equity:opening balances

2024-02-03 * Grocery Store  ; weekly shop
    expenses:food:groceries            $42.50
    assets:bank:checking

2024-02-14 ! Employer
    ; A pending paycheck: the amount lands later.
    assets:bank:checking            $2,500.00
    income:salary

2024-03-01 * Rent
    expenses:housing:rent           $1,200.00
    assets:bank:checking

2024-03-15 * Coffee  ; receipt:yes
    expenses:food:coffee               $4.75
    assets:bank:checking
